<view class="about-page liquid-theme-page" style="padding-top: {{safeTop}}px;">
  <image class="theme-ambient-image" src="/assets/home/home-ambient-v6.jpg" mode="aspectFill" aria-hidden="true"></image>
  <view class="about-heading">
    <view class="about-back" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
    <view class="about-heading-title">关于</view>
    <view class="about-heading-space"></view>
  </view>
  <view class="about-card">
    <view class="about-app-name">英语知识卡片本</view>
    <view class="about-tagline">随手记下你遇到的英文，轻松回顾。</view>
    <view class="about-divider"></view>
    <view class="about-desc">这是一个用来记录和回顾英语内容的小程序。你可以把平时在视频、新闻、聊天、工作中遇到的单词、短语或句子添加成卡片，写下自己的理解和遇到场景，也可以从公开素材、听力和词书开始学习。进入“复习”，回顾自己想记住的英语。</view>
    <view class="about-version">v1.0.0</view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card about-usage-card">
    <view class="about-section-title">怎么使用</view>
    <view class="about-step">
      <view class="step-num">1</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">添加卡片</view>
        <view class="step-desc">记录英文内容、自己的理解和遇到场景。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="about-step">
      <view class="step-num">2</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">开始复习</view>
        <view class="step-desc">先回忆英文含义，再选择对应理解；不确定时可以选择“不知道”。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="about-step">
      <view class="step-num">3</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">巩固理解</view>
        <view class="step-desc">答错后查看提示并再次练习，需要时打开详情，理解后返回继续。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="about-step">
      <view class="step-num">4</view>
      <view class="step-content">
        <view class="step-title">回看记录</view>
        <view class="step-desc">查看"今天看过"和"历史记录"。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card about-contact-card">
    <view class="about-section-title">联系开发者</view>
    <view class="about-contact-desc">如果你在使用中遇到问题，或者有功能建议，可以通过邮箱反馈。</view>
    <view class="about-contact-btn" bindtap="onContactDeveloper">联系开发者</view>
  </view>
</view>
